    "chunk_text": "\u00e6nigre d\u00e6de, \u00feonne man by\u00f0 nydwyrhta, \u00feonne by\u00f0 se gebeorges \u00fee bet wyr\u00f0e, \u00fee he for & gyf hwa hw\u00e6t ungewealdes gede\u00f0, ne by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t eallunga na gelic, \u00fee hit gewealdes gewur\u00fee. \u00deis is \u00feonne seo lihtingc, \u00fee ic wylle eallon folce gebeorgan, \u00fee hig \u00e6r \u00feyson mid gedrehte w\u00e6ran \u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t ic bebeode eallum minan gerefan, \u00fe\u00e6t hi on minan agenan me rihtlice tilian & & gif hwa \u00e6fter \u00f0am wite crafige, beo he his weres scyldig wi\u00f0 \u00feone cingc. And gif hwa cwydeleas of \u00feysum life gewite, si hit \u00feurh his gymeleaste, si hit \u00feurh f\u00e6rlicne dea\u00f0, Ac beo be his dihte seo \u00e6ht gescyft swy\u00f0e rihte wife & cildum & nehmagum, \u00e6lcum be \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6\u00f0e, eorles swa \u00f0\u00e6rto gebyrige, \u00fe\u00e6t syndon viii hors, iiii gesadelode & iiii unsadelode, & iiii helmas & & sy\u00f0\u00f0an cingces \u00feegnas, \u00fee him nyhste syndan: iiii hors, ii gesadelode & ii unsadelode, & ii swurd & medemra \u00feegna: hors & his ger\u00e6da & his w\u00e6pn o\u00f0\u00f0e his healsfang on wessexan; & on myrcan ii And cingces \u00feegnes heregeata inne mid denum, \u00fee his socne h\u00e6bbe: iiii pund. & gif he to \u00feam cingce fur\u00f0or cy\u00f0\u00f0e h\u00e6bbe: ii hors, i gesadelod & o\u00f0er unsadelod, & swurd & ii & se \u00f0e l\u00e6sse mage si: ii",
